| `dependency_audit.accepted.<app>.<advisory>.review_by` | string | `2027-01-21`, 90 days after the row was written | a calendar date written `YYYY-MM-DD` | `scripts/audit_dependencies.py`, through `scripts/config_loader.py`'s `dependency_audit.accepted` row | Sets the last day the acceptance holds: from the next day, as `scripts/run_date.py` `today` reads it, `make fe-audit` fails the row as expired until the date is renewed or the row removed. Another spelling is refused with exit 14. | how far out a row may be set: `dependency_audit.max_review_days` | when `frontend_stack` is `astro` |
